## Model card

- **Name:** GLM-5.3-Flash-X (OpenRouter SKU `z-ai/glm-5.3-flashx`)
- **Short description:** A distinct Zhipu SKU alongside GLM-5.3, GLM-5.3-Flash and GLM-5.3-Prime — the "X" tier has its own OpenRouter route and accepted-parameter list, but no weights repo, no models.dev entry and no benchmark data has ever been published for it. **It is a separate ID from the open-weights GLM-5.3-Flash, and its data must not be conflated with that model's.**
- **Provider / access:** OpenRouter only, as `z-ai/glm-5.3-flashx`. Accepted parameters on that route: `max_tokens`, `reasoning`, `reasoning_effort`, `response_format`, `temperature`, `tools`, `tool_choice`, `top_p`, `top_k`.
- **Release / knowledge:** not found.
- **IDs:** `z-ai/glm-5.3-flashx` (OpenRouter). No alias found in models.dev under any spelling (`glm-5.3-flash-x`, `glm-5.3-flashx`).
- **Context window:** not verifiable — the OpenRouter guide page carries no context-window figure.
- **Modalities:** not verifiable.
- **Pricing:** not verifiable — no price is published on the OpenRouter route or anywhere else.
- **Architecture:** not verifiable — no weights repo is public (`huggingface.co/zai-org/GLM-5.3-FlashX` returns 401).

